<title>CANADA: Westcoast Energy Inc has smaller Q3 loss.</title>
<headline>Westcoast Energy Inc has smaller Q3 loss.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr   loss		C$0.06     loss	C$0.19</p>
<p> Net   loss		 5,000     loss	16,000</p>
<p> Revs		     711,000		  725,000</p>
<p>	   9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr     profit	  C$1.42   profit	C$1.23</p>
<p> Net     profit	 139,000   profit     107,000</p>
<p> Revs		   3,154,000		2,813,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  98,102		   87,114</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>Note: Westcoast said in the third quarter it had a weather-adjusted loss of C$0.05 vs. a loss of C$0.17 in the same period of 1995. Weather adjusted earnings for nine months were C$1.29 in 1996 vs. C$1.20 in 1995.</p>
<p>1995 nine months earnings include non-recurring item of C$6 million or C$0.07 a share for income recognition of an allowance for funds used in construction of Empire State pipeline.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Vancouver Bureau (604) 664-7314</p>
</text>
